# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Publication .gitignore -- Guinand-Weil verification chain
#
# IMPORTANT: this file deliberately does NOT contain `*.json` or `*.log`.
#
# The parent monorepo's root .gitignore ignores BOTH globally (root .gitignore
# lines 47 and 63), which is why the input spectrum, the certified eigen matrix
# and all 12 forensic run logs were never tracked there -- `git ls-files
# "*.json"` and `git ls-files "*.log"` both return 0 in the monorepo.
#
# The Zenodo record for this release promises "complete forensic audit trails
# and cryptographic provenance manifests". Shipping a repository with zero
# logs would make that promise false, so the two rules are not inherited here.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- runtime / build artefacts (never sources) -----------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/
*.tmp
*.tmp.*
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/

# --- secrets (never publish) ----------------------------------------------
.env
*.env
.env.*
auth.json
*.key
*.pem
*secret*
*token*
*token*.json
credentials*.json

# --- local databases (state, not source) ----------------------------------
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.dump
